  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With there being a new menu for IK and FBT I think now would be an ideal time to get the \"--legacy-fbt-calibrate\" command for FBT calibration out of the startup commands and into the games menu. \nIt'd be more intuitive as well.\nI'd love to be able to use either or without restarting vrchat. (Or telling people to restart and see if it works better for them in an avatar.)\nIt might be more fitting to rename them something along the lines of \"Calibrate Static\" and \"Calibrate Dynamic\" as well, so it's more clear in behavior.",
